  },
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": 205,
      "label": "巡逻班的建议",
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER205.YBC",
      "sha256": "17ed73396b735b0470ff4abb635aaec5821aad9aacb16b7fda28222a0156447e",
      "text_pool": [
        {
          "text": "……您是說巡邏班吧？",
          "pool_parameter": 352,
          "raw_sha256": "db89243fbfc90aba240f72862953451ce0151ad850e2c39c996de05b68ac6b67"
        },
        {
          "text": "從過去到現在，",
          "pool_parameter": 256,
          "raw_sha256": "c1cfc0ef3ced2e389d87b531238a65c87988aed2745a2f8a7840622bb364d981"
        },
        {
          "text": "如果要說純潔之盾有什麼傳統的話，",
          "pool_parameter": 544,
          "raw_sha256": "1b8e2bb5d2e10095ccd1597632ed18afb5bfd572b2423159be291fff56ca0fe0"
        },
        {
          "text": "我想……應該就只有巡邏班了吧。",
          "pool_parameter": 512,
          "raw_sha256": "3df61796021d139c1781c75961d1de61934a61cc6366ae4b2c00327569cbf98f"
        },
        {
          "text": "……雖然法爾德閣下您說的沒錯。",
          "pool_parameter": 512,
          "raw_sha256": "1809c0c9bf97608753308698f49ef69d4cbada9ade2b0b77f5eaa17f6a4a4e6a"
        },
        {
          "text": "然而對現在只有三個人的純潔之盾來說，",
          "pool_parameter": 608,
          "raw_sha256": "d0e8497669a18ba28ba0d6e8c64e90e75f004d7b3a13eddbdefd39bbd3eb4fdb"
        },
        {
          "text": "這不會有點太勉強了嗎。",
          "pool_parameter": 384,
          "raw_sha256": "7095dc94b79fd00157fa5383149f6de53609654e738320a4f3220334bed302d3"
        },
        {
          "text": "難道你打算讓他們一直待在這裡，",
          "pool_parameter": 512,
          "raw_sha256": "eaa52244569b68efd9ad8e22621047e0c081c3a58273b135504999a2538b777d"
        },
        {
          "text": "每天就只是面對著書桌嗎？",
          "pool_parameter": 416,
          "raw_sha256": "369f88823289c672b7e760aad1e2dadf7160b72aef5523012e571f80c71b6b9c"
        },
        {
          "text": "在那種年紀裡，",
          "pool_parameter": 256,
          "raw_sha256": "7e6b0d0437ac38b0f7ff6e97d7201df89ac5c9df97ca5aaea322dd28b18371f7"
        },
        {
          "text": "還是要多出去走動走動比較好。",
          "pool_parameter": 480,
          "raw_sha256": "e06db4b44c765acb0174701532c838a91288e657009c63f300843a522223f314"
        },
        {
          "text": "…………",
          "pool_parameter": 160,
          "raw_sha256": "d3dfc2d846acb5d6a1685660a67e0842ea7fc5e0444b0da7d47e1c94af914b8c"
        },
        {
          "text": "而且相比之下，",
          "pool_parameter": 256,
          "raw_sha256": "a61bd32f9d9c8bfcfb86df51accb16a82282705f46d5708a2e28d674badf7329"
        },
        {
          "text": "老是聽我們這些老頭子說話，",
          "pool_parameter": 448,
          "raw_sha256": "6d2b456842e6b0d6e5758f6c9d2e8371573673f02cb75910723d4423876f9da9"
        },
        {
          "text": "應該是一點好處也沒有吧？",
          "pool_parameter": 416,
          "raw_sha256": "1ed7d504f02e3b44b26465168fd10e25acddb24716cdb763bc5d30802bd7aa3e"
        },
        {
          "text": "沒錯吧，德涅西亞？",
          "pool_parameter": 320,
          "raw_sha256": "c6e47d8461e8f96cde7bf0882c08e9eebdc7ef33d9db35da6ac521ab72e5a349"
        },
        {
          "text": "…………",
          "pool_parameter": 160,
          "raw_sha256": "d3dfc2d846acb5d6a1685660a67e0842ea7fc5e0444b0da7d47e1c94af914b8c"
        },
        {
          "text": "沉默就代表肯定我說的話囉。",
          "pool_parameter": 448,
          "raw_sha256": "c1e5f6dbdaaafc6155da60fd18e66a19d657e74ef74dab3983888bf868abd904"
        },
        {
          "text": "你呀，從什麼時候開始，",
          "pool_parameter": 384,
          "raw_sha256": "5664175a77acde03278452d30429a5e63de36cfecb1353276a2dac4321406df1"
        },
        {
          "text": "竟然開始模仿起帕蘭達因的行事方針了？",
          "pool_parameter": 608,
          "raw_sha256": "8b1e69099270b224ed5f10e0150699d855fdac066636f23e85a884cd4b696ab0"
        },
        {
          "text": "要是你也遵循著聖瑟維艾斯的想法的話，",
          "pool_parameter": 608,
          "raw_sha256": "647ddf8ebeaa2ab1a7561010ee6a5c7ce3ef2f8e65fad5af5cdf4ea5cb4d54d2"
        },
        {
          "text": "就會知道我其實是不想太輕率地回應呀。",
          "pool_parameter": 608,
          "raw_sha256": "748a3c81d1cb9a57262937e4a63857c639c72810febad0949a49368e3a1ea386"
        },
        {
          "text": "現在可沒有那個時間讓你好好考慮了。",
          "pool_parameter": 576,
          "raw_sha256": "dc7760f6d3ea633cd6dc46c1d82e385316eac1f2b028620bf50b2b32a3808b73"
        },
        {
          "text": "…………",
          "pool_parameter": 160,
          "raw_sha256": "d3dfc2d846acb5d6a1685660a67e0842ea7fc5e0444b0da7d47e1c94af914b8c"
        },
        {
          "text": "…………",
          "pool_parameter": 160,
          "raw_sha256": "d3dfc2d846acb5d6a1685660a67e0842ea7fc5e0444b0da7d47e1c94af914b8c"
        },
        {
          "text": "那麼，法爾德閣下，",
          "pool_parameter": 320,
          "raw_sha256": "a8b22d0acf60a5bd81a401464e5f0bb8c330adafe574a69630375f5faff13981"
        },
        {
          "text": "您認為這次應該從哪裡著手呢？",
          "pool_parameter": 480,
          "raw_sha256": "9372b5a46ee754f5fd062f25d5bd2bb3a74ca8ca9110e36f34e40d8aabb2a290"
        },
        {
          "text": "一開始的時候，",
          "pool_parameter": 256,
          "raw_sha256": "44e617fd620c5be4a38c982b60561ff054409b22a9360c0e847f7efc296ec1d9"
        },
        {
          "text": "就先去一趟貝亞托利斯的湧泉谷吧。",
          "pool_parameter": 544,
          "raw_sha256": "97b5e13028577c7825e49f3b7d26d952bc36713fef982232d195ecfa5c981a44"
        },
        {
          "text": "我們對水戰應該是沒有什麼經驗吧？",
          "pool_parameter": 544,
          "raw_sha256": "86acda444a6c3c88b78436c0b665a241f85a6ffbeb26705c9557f2dcd1fe3ae1"
        },
        {
          "text": "貝亞托利斯……",
          "pool_parameter": 256,
          "raw_sha256": "592568e820dcd3ca7afce289ab2024911ad26c2cc945a3c3b24c9f3df00daf42"
        },
        {
          "text": "無論需要嘗試多少次，",
          "pool_parameter": 352,
          "raw_sha256": "ac00ae1984fe962a8f536bf7833ca149aa4869e82c4fb32b4f6a7e93f48c9f8c"
        },
        {
          "text": "都要讓他們習慣在各式各樣的地形中行動。",
          "pool_parameter": 640,
          "raw_sha256": "0c17c359a7b4878de62500cc6a1e7c1e118c99cf842379130a8003d3bcb790c7"
        },
        {
          "text": "要讓他們瞭解「匍伏蔓延而來之物」的特性。",
          "pool_parameter": 672,
          "raw_sha256": "7105c3932d70d489fa69390d88cfc63fb6177097740bb3773efff76f2cf7eb56"
        },
        {
          "text": "不管少做了哪一樣，",
          "pool_parameter": 320,
          "raw_sha256": "a0448cbc1c73a7571002d6778091e8875439ba3b9689397f9a2f0249adae7e98"
        },
        {
          "text": "都能不能算是完整地教育了那些孩子們。",
          "pool_parameter": 608,
          "raw_sha256": "24eec500bf68eccbe224cd052c6c7ab9a0a129b4eab919fd468e33495b9d2b5b"
        },
        {
          "text": "…………",
          "pool_parameter": 160,
          "raw_sha256": "d3dfc2d846acb5d6a1685660a67e0842ea7fc5e0444b0da7d47e1c94af914b8c"
        },
        {
          "text": "既然我現在寄於純潔之盾籬下，",
          "pool_parameter": 480,
          "raw_sha256": "694c8e841c1ac0b099074e6b0900727a203b8f46507e18c9b7785556213c09d0"
        },
        {
          "text": "那麼我就必須負起給予你們建議的責任。",
          "pool_parameter": 608,
          "raw_sha256": "1eb1ffed151235744f4170918d8674b2b8041c2e9a93ef497671b3c98e0a1961"
        },
        {
          "text": "我可是不敢怠慢了應盡的義務。",
          "pool_parameter": 480,
          "raw_sha256": "d8f5178a3cc73dd09df4dc5895f088b846a8ecc9b886f2cf815525fb26ca6dd5"
        },
        {
          "text": "法爾德……",
          "pool_parameter": 192,
          "raw_sha256": "50cdeddf4734188318ec0fcd85544d2d3c2d641de46f6b6ace9b1016c48a5925"
        },
        {
          "text": "……當然，",
          "pool_parameter": 192,
          "raw_sha256": "cdff05bb39f3152e4f5e1efef97a19ecabc9813e91fb3423d17cfb230b6136e5"
        },
        {
          "text": "一切的決定都在這個年輕的賢者手裡。",
          "pool_parameter": 576,
          "raw_sha256": "b1c43c6e67d3a9f9cbb61eedb2740c0b0cbb41c92afec104f503b23e6deabb05"
        },
        {
          "text": "我的意見是不是會被採用，",
          "pool_parameter": 416,
          "raw_sha256": "8fe890d1038f3dd3b1fa6881559ef2f563afa9bfde1c6d531dd7993d2250ed11"
        },
        {
          "text": "其實對我來說，並不是很在意。",
          "pool_parameter": 480,
          "raw_sha256": "226f3ed1e1804fd6010aef472ca8007712d5ea983250da9f4a7562d48bff4ae1"
        },
        {
          "text": "…………",
          "pool_parameter": 160,
          "raw_sha256": "d3dfc2d846acb5d6a1685660a67e0842ea7fc5e0444b0da7d47e1c94af914b8c"
        },
        {
          "text": "那麼……",
          "pool_parameter": 160,
          "raw_sha256": "1a27933fa57cf49a3d07a5b88647b625caf0cefc0531140cc9ab096e02c80241"
        },
        {
          "text": "我還有點事情要做，先失陪了。",
          "pool_parameter": 480,
          "raw_sha256": "3235d8ba42ea3bcf936eefac30b6ab282458c373f9a4d13b136074523422d00f"
        },
        {
          "text": "…………",
          "pool_parameter": 160,
          "raw_sha256": "d3dfc2d846acb5d6a1685660a67e0842ea7fc5e0444b0da7d47e1c94af914b8c"
        },
        {
          "text": "…………",
          "pool_parameter": 160,
          "raw_sha256": "d3dfc2d846acb5d6a1685660a67e0842ea7fc5e0444b0da7d47e1c94af914b8c"
        },
        {
          "text": "都已經到了這把年紀，還是有這麼多意見。",
          "pool_parameter": 640,
          "raw_sha256": "4720c56289f8f0a376a072066abc62a5c4962f62c54ed7b92dcc4c73240e7bc0"
        },
        {
          "text": "那一副好像要吃定你的樣子，",
          "pool_parameter": 448,
          "raw_sha256": "4bfc8febc36a975790786e5fb70bcfc2342b275b8d3e73dbfe7a775f4f644614"
        },
        {
          "text": "真是讓我想起了過去年輕的時候。",
          "pool_parameter": 512,
          "raw_sha256": "9af7ec42385a1aa11e6564019d7647410a836a9f8a13b0f33dff8f978c8d6129"
        },
        {
          "text": "…………",
          "pool_parameter": 160,
          "raw_sha256": "d3dfc2d846acb5d6a1685660a67e0842ea7fc5e0444b0da7d47e1c94af914b8c"
        },
        {
          "text": "你能理解法爾德的這份心意嗎？",
          "pool_parameter": 480,
          "raw_sha256": "c2785ce5ebfc25411b53aa280362a1949de9399fce8bb77241237e3c44946a3e"
        },
        {
          "text": "我能夠理解他的想法。",
          "pool_parameter": 352,
          "raw_sha256": "de6b73b4a1ed9e5ae0cd5ee3171df7205398b9461a0e978c1327ecd4716c7f6a"
        },
        {
          "text": "……純潔之盾還是得去完成那些應該要完成的",
          "pool_parameter": 672,
          "raw_sha256": "b1f938a25d91787e6e7343e8418a6f8fd1f6524c33afd5adecefc6351cc58a94"
        },
        {
          "text": "任務呀。",
          "pool_parameter": 160,
          "raw_sha256": "fd6bc789221cc058ab7daeb45cc053979bad542daa52cbbdebe291d426431093"
        },
        {
          "text": "感謝你。",
          "pool_parameter": 160,
          "raw_sha256": "033bc82c523e872620006a40fb302df498a3e8cefdb24c27e0e34555c0a6cc3e"
        },
        {
          "text": "…………",
          "pool_parameter": 160,
          "raw_sha256": "d3dfc2d846acb5d6a1685660a67e0842ea7fc5e0444b0da7d47e1c94af914b8c"
        },
        {
          "text": "……那麼，就這樣了吧。",
          "pool_parameter": 384,
          "raw_sha256": "6efb3f133318805f635df223e9020e59b41f6205d7f443ab54bf623d8eb3e213"
        },
        {
          "text": "是的……",
          "pool_parameter": 160,
          "raw_sha256": "01e7fbe2363ed31d320e3353e6513c23e1debf2d0791e8caf0e5891273e273d9"
        }
      ],
      "text_encoding": "cp950",
      "cp950_extension_indices": [],
      "pages": [
