          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text_indices": [
            11
          ],
          "text": "…………",
          "background": 6,
          "characters": [
            {
              "slot": 8,
              "id": 117,
              "kind": "portrait",
              "asset_key": "portrait:117"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "source_offset": 292,
          "speaker": "portrait:117",
          "text_indices": [
            12,
            13,
            14,
            15
          ],
          "text": "而且相比之下，\n老是聽我們這些老頭子說話，\n應該是一點好處也沒有吧？\n沒錯吧，德涅西亞？",
          "background": 6,
          "characters": [
            {
              "slot": 8,
